g  multiple candidate selection techniques  so as you can see we were able to make a  good improvement in recall after  applying these techniques  and the precision would definitely go  below uh two percent or three percent in  this case  but we are not worried about precision  because we know that the supervised  layer is pretty good at  filtering out the incorrect name pairs  so i i mentioned the supervised layer a  lot  during the presentation and we are  currently working on a supervised layer  and  it's giving pretty good results and it  is able to increase the precision  while maintaining a high recall and  i think that's perhaps something to  discuss later so  yeah thank you that's it from my from me  thanks for listening
 

